flowchart LR
  Q[Query] --> X[Query expansion / multi-query]
  X --> BM25[BM25 sparse]
  X --> Dense[Dense encoder\nhashing proxy or ST]
  BM25 --> RRF[Reciprocal Rank Fusion]
  Dense --> VS[Vector store\nmemory/FAISS/Chroma]
  VS --> RRF
  RRF --> RR[Rerank\ncross-encoder or lexical]
  RR --> CTX[Parent context assemble]
  CTX --> LLM[Mock / cloud LLM]
  LLM --> Out[Answer + citations + confidence]
